  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline VAMOS is a six-sided evolution of A5 developed in collaboration with Jonas Eriksson of Tennisnerd. Built from the same underlying platform as A5, VAMOS replaces the smooth round profile with a 1.23 mm hexagonal geometry to increase mechanical ball grip, bite and launch angle. While A5 generates much of its spin through elite snapback and low friction, VAMOS adds stronger string-to-ball interaction, creating a more pronounced spin response while retaining the connected feel and predictable control associated with A5. Exceptional tension maintenance and strong directional accuracy make it particularly well suited to aggressive ball strikers.",

    "zh": "Toroline VAMOS 是基于 A5 平台开发的六边形进阶版本，由 Toroline 与 Tennisnerd 的 Jonas Eriksson 合作研发。VAMOS 延续 A5 的核心材料与连接感，但将圆形结构改为 1.23 毫米六边形截面，从而增加球线与网球之间的机械摩擦、咬球能力以及出球角度。A5 主要依靠低摩擦和极高 Snapback 制造旋转，而 VAMOS 在此基础上增加更明显的机械抓球，因此能够提供更强烈的旋转反馈和更高的 Launch Angle，同时保留 A5 标志性的 Connected Feel 与精准控制。再加上优秀的保磅表现，它非常适合高速挥拍、积极进攻并重视旋转和方向控制的球员。"
  },

